@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor Black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor LightBlue

title Registro de Propriedade - Parte 2: Aprovações e Execução

actor "Instituição\nFinanceira" as IF
actor "Cartório" as Cartorio
actor "Prefeitura" as Prefeitura
participant "Offchain\nConsumer" as OC
participant "Blockchain\n(Besu)" as BC
participant "Event\nListener" as EL
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

note over IF, DB
**ESTADO INICIAL:**
Propriedade aguardando 3 aprovações
requestHash já definido na blockchain
end note

== Aprovação 1/3: Instituição Financeira ==

IF -> OC: **POST /api/properties/approve**\n{\n  requestHash: "0xabc...",\n  institution: "FINANCIAL"\n}
activate OC

OC -> BC: approveRegistrationAsFinancial(requestHash)
activate BC

BC -> BC: Validate:\n- pendingRegistrations[requestHash].exists\n- !financialApproved

BC -> BC: pendingRegistrations[requestHash]\n  .financialApproved = true

BC -> BC: **Emit RegistrationApproved**\n{\n  requestHash,\n  institution: "FINANCIAL",\n  approver: msg.sender\n}

BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL

EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-approved\n{\n  requestHash,\n  institution: "FINANCIAL",\n  approver\n}
activate Orch

Orch -> DB: Record approval 1/3
Orch --> EL: 200 OK
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL
deactivate OC

== Aprovação 2/3: Cartório ==

Cartorio -> OC: **POST /api/properties/approve**\n{\n  requestHash: "0xabc...",\n  institution: "REGISTRY_OFFICE"\n}
activate OC

OC -> BC: approveRegistrationAsRegistryOffice(requestHash)
activate BC

BC -> BC: pendingRegistrations[requestHash]\n  .registryOfficeApproved = true

BC -> BC: **Emit RegistrationApproved**\n{\n  requestHash,\n  institution: "REGISTRY_OFFICE",\n  approver\n}

BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL

EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-approved
activate Orch
Orch -> DB: Record approval 2/3
Orch --> EL: 200 OK
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL
deactivate OC

== Aprovação 3/3: Prefeitura (Auto-execução) ==

Prefeitura -> OC: **POST /api/properties/approve**\n{\n  requestHash: "0xabc...",\n  institution: "MUNICIPALITY"\n}
activate OC

OC -> BC: approveRegistrationAsMunicipality(requestHash)
activate BC

BC -> BC: pendingRegistrations[requestHash]\n  .municipalityApproved = true

BC -> BC: **Emit RegistrationApproved**\n{\n  requestHash,\n  institution: "MUNICIPALITY",\n  approver\n}

BC -> BC: **Check: All 3 approvals granted?**\nfinancialApproved ✓\nregistryOfficeApproved ✓\nmunicipalityApproved ✓

BC -> BC: **AUTO-EXECUTE:**\n_executeRegistration(requestHash)

BC -> BC: mint(beneficiary, matricula)\nTransfer tokens: 0x0 → beneficiary

BC -> BC: propertyExists[matricula] = true\npropertyOwner[matricula] = beneficiary

BC -> BC: pendingRegistrations[requestHash]\n  .executed = true

BC -> BC: **Emit RegistrationExecuted**\n{\n  requestHash,\n  matricula,\n  beneficiary\n}

BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL

EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-executed\n{\n  requestHash,\n  matriculaId,\n  beneficiary,\n  transactionHash\n}
activate Orch

Orch -> DB: UPDATE properties\nSET status = 'OK',\n    proprietario = beneficiary\nWHERE request_hash = ?
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Updated
deactivate DB

Orch --> EL: 200 OK
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL
deactivate OC

note over IF, DB
**RESULTADO FINAL:**
✅ Propriedade registrada com sucesso
✅ Tokens mintados para o proprietário
✅ Status: OK
✅ Ownership estabelecido na blockchain
end note

@enduml
